{"id":"n64655-1-7","stage":1,"title":"떠들다 · 喧闹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64655-1-7-1","ko":"언니가 방에서 공부하니까 떠들면 안 돼.","zh":"姐姐在房间里学习，所以不能吵闹。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니가","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방에서","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부하니까","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠들면","meaning":"喧闹","explanation":"떠들다：喧闹；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"떠들다","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64655","senseId":"1","lemma":"떠들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]},{"id":"11ba432b1719e409","term":"떠들다","zh":"喧闹","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3","entryId":"64655","definition":"喧哗吵闹。","pronunciation":["떠ː들다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0c379477ad649a06102.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64655-1-7-2","ko":"네, 조용히 할게요.","zh":"好的，我会保持安静的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할게요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"安静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"任何声音都没有地。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干